    "Every notification, feed and interruption asks for the same thing: switch.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque notification, chaque fil, chaque interruption demande la même chose : changer."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cada notificación, cada feed, cada interrupción pide lo mismo: cambiar."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jede Benachrichtigung, jeder Feed, jede Unterbrechung verlangt dasselbe: wechseln."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ogni notifica, ogni feed, ogni interruzione chiede la stessa cosa: cambiare."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything will be deleted and REBOOT will return to its first launch. Your Apple subscription is managed separately in your Apple ID settings and is not deleted by this.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout sera supprimé et REBOOT reviendra à son premier lancement. Votre abonnement Apple est géré séparément dans les réglages de votre identifiant Apple et n'est pas supprimé par cette action."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Todo se borrará y REBOOT volverá a su primer arranque. Tu suscripción de Apple se gestiona por separado en los ajustes de tu ID de Apple y no se elimina con esto."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alles wird gelöscht und REBOOT kehrt zum ersten Start zurück. Dein Apple-Abo wird separat in den Apple-ID-Einstellungen verwaltet und dadurch nicht gelöscht."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tutto verrà cancellato e REBOOT tornerà al primo avvio. Il tuo abbonamento Apple è gestito separatamente nelle impostazioni ID Apple e non viene cancellato da questa azione."
          }
        }
      }
    },
