          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rebuild your attention.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reconstruisez votre attention."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reconstruye tu atención."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Baue deine Aufmerksamkeit neu auf."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ricostruisci la tua attenzione."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recent recall attempts lost most of the material. Today closes the source sooner and asks for more.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les derniers essais de rappel ont perdu l'essentiel du contenu. Aujourd'hui, on ferme la source plus tôt et on en demande plus."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Los últimos intentos de recuerdo perdieron la mayor parte del material. Hoy se cierra la fuente antes y se pide más."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die letzten Abruf-Versuche haben das meiste Material verloren. Heute wird die Quelle früher geschlossen und mehr verlangt."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I recenti tentativi di richiamo hanno perso gran parte del materiale. Oggi si chiude la fonte prima e si chiede di più."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remember what I consume": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retenir ce que je consomme"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordar lo que consumo"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Behalten, was ich aufnehme"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ricordare ciò che consumo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remembering is depth's proof. Today tests how much of the harder material comes back without the source.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se souvenir est la preuve de la profondeur. Aujourd'hui teste combien du contenu difficile revient sans la source."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordar es la prueba de la profundidad. Hoy pone a prueba cuánto del material difícil vuelve sin la fuente."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erinnern ist der Beweis von Tiefe. Heute testet sich, wie viel des schwierigeren Materials ohne die Quelle zurückkommt."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ricordare è la prova della profondità. Oggi si verifica quanto del materiale più difficile torna senza la fonte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Remembering what I just read or watched": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Retenir ce que je viens de lire ou de voir"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordar lo que acabo de leer o ver"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Behalten, was ich gerade gelesen oder gesehen habe"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ricordare cosa ho appena letto o visto"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reported energy is low today. The session gets shorter so quality doesn't have to.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'énergie annoncée est basse aujourd'hui. La séance raccourcit pour que la qualité n'ait pas à le faire."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La energía reportada hoy está baja. La sesión se acorta para que la calidad no tenga que hacerlo."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die gemeldete Energie ist heute niedrig. Die Sitzung wird kürzer, damit die Qualität es nicht muss."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
