          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tested against your own comparable sessions, not averages.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Testées contre vos propres séances comparables, pas des moyennes."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Probadas contra tus propias sesiones comparables, no contra promedios."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Getestet an deinen eigenen vergleichbaren Sitzungen, nicht an Durchschnitten."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verificate sulle tue sessioni comparabili, non su medie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That still tells us something.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela nous dit quand même quelque chose."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eso todavía nos dice algo."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das verrät uns trotzdem etwas."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo ci dice comunque qualcosa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The conditions that help you": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les conditions qui vous aident"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las condiciones que te ayudan"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Bedingungen, die dir helfen"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le condizioni che ti aiutano"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first week is calibration. We start with what you tell us, then REBOOT learns from what actually happens.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La première semaine sert d'étalonnage. Nous partons de ce que vous nous dites, puis REBOOT apprend de ce qui se passe vraiment."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La primera semana es de calibración. Empezamos con lo que nos cuentas y luego REBOOT aprende de lo que ocurre de verdad."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die erste Woche ist Kalibrierung. Wir starten mit dem, was du uns sagst, dann lernt REBOOT aus dem, was wirklich passiert."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La prima settimana è di calibrazione. Partiamo da quello che ci dici, poi REBOOT impara da ciò che accade davvero."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The full program continues with a subscription. Your Day 1 session and insights stay yours either way.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La suite du programme nécessite un abonnement. Votre séance du Jour 1 et vos observations restent les vôtres dans tous les cas."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El programa completo continúa con una suscripción. Tu sesión del Día 1 y sus observaciones siguen siendo tuyas de todos modos."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das volle Programm setzt mit einem Abo fort. Deine Tag-1-Sitzung und Erkenntnisse bleiben in jedem Fall deine."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il programma completo continua con un abbonamento. La sessione del Giorno 1 e le osservazioni restano tue in ogni caso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The honest one, not the most admirable one.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La réponse honnête, pas la plus admirable."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La respuesta sincera, no la más admirable."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die ehrliche Antwort, nicht die bewundernswerteste."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La risposta sincera, non quella più ammirevole."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original task is usually lost": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La tâche d'origine est généralement perdue"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La tarea original suele perderse"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die ursprüngliche Aufgabe geht meist verloren"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'attività originale di solito si perde"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The phone": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le téléphone"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El teléfono"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Handy"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il telefono"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The problem isn't that you've lost attention. Your environment keeps rewarding the opposite behaviour.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le problème n'est pas que vous avez perdu votre attention. Votre environnement récompense sans cesse le comportement inverse."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El problema no es que hayas perdido atención. Tu entorno sigue premiando el comportamiento contrario."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Problem ist nicht, dass du deine Aufmerksamkeit verloren hast. Deine Umgebung belohnt ständig das Gegenteil."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il problema non è che hai perso attenzione. Il tuo ambiente continua a premiare il comportamento opposto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This becomes the direction everything else adapts around.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Elle devient la direction autour de laquelle tout le reste s'adapte."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se convierte en la dirección sobre la que se adapta todo lo demás."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sie wird zur Richtung, um die sich alles andere anpasst."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diventa la direzione attorno alla quale si adatta tutto il resto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is not a verdict. It is where REBOOT starts — and the first week begins replacing these answers with what actually happens.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce n'est pas un verdict. C'est là où REBOOT commence — et la première semaine remplace ces réponses par ce qui se passe réellement."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto no es un veredicto. Es donde empieza REBOOT, y la primera semana comienza a sustituir estas respuestas por lo que ocurre de verdad."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies ist kein Urteil. Hier beginnt REBOOT – und die erste Woche ersetzt diese Antworten durch das, was wirklich passiert."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo non è un verdetto. È dove REBOOT inizia, e la prima settimana comincia a sostituire queste risposte con ciò che accade davvero."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes your sessions, profile, rules, experiments, environment setup, and Operating Manual from this iPhone. It cannot be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cela supprime définitivement vos séances, profil, règles, expériences, environnement et Manuel de cet iPhone. Action irréversible."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esto borra permanentemente tus sesiones, perfil, reglas, experimentos, entorno y Manual de este iPhone. No se puede deshacer."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dies löscht endgültig deine Sitzungen, dein Profil, Regeln, Experimente, Umgebung und Handbuch von diesem iPhone. Unumkehrbar."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questo cancella per sempre sessioni, profilo, regole, esperimenti, ambiente e Manuale da questo iPhone. Non si può annullare."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This phase looks for the conditions around your deeper work. A real project is the cleanest probe.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette phase cherche les conditions de ton travail en profondeur. Un vrai projet est la sonde la plus nette."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta fase busca las condiciones de tu trabajo profundo. Un proyecto real es la prueba más limpia."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Phase sucht die Bedingungen deiner Tiefenarbeit. Ein echtes Projekt ist der klarste Test."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questa fase cerca le condizioni del tuo lavoro profondo. Un progetto reale è la prova più pulita."
          }
        }
      }
    },
